      "message": "I know this code was there before, but it\u0027s worth mentioning that it doesn\u0027t work for CMake multiconfiguration builds, like the ones it creates for Visual Studio. For that, we\u0027d have to also look at `CMAKE_CONFIGURATION_TYPES` (https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/variable/CMAKE_CONFIGURATION_TYPES.html). Something for a followup task.",
