      "writtenOn": "2025-04-03T14:05:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, so maybe we actually should be setting the default in CMake at all, and instead just use `!NDEBUG || TINT_ENABLE_IR_VALIDATION` in the source instead?",
